{
  "info": {
    "name": "NutriBase API",
    "description": "## NutriBase API — Guided Demo Journey\n\nThis collection walks through all major features of the NutriBase REST API in a logical sequence. Follow the numbered chapters from top to bottom for a complete demonstration.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n1. Run **1.1 Login as Admin** — token auto-saved to `admin_token`\n2. Run **1.2 Login as Doctor** — token auto-saved to `doctor_token`\n3. Run **1.3 Login as Patient (Marko)** — token auto-saved to `patient_token`\n4. All subsequent requests use saved tokens automatically\n\n---\n\n## Seeded Demo Accounts\n| Role | Email | Password |\n|---|---|---|\n| Admin | hajrovica@gmail.com | Test12345 |\n| Doctor | doctor@nutribase.test | password |\n| Patient — Marko Petrović (patient 15) | marko.petrovic@nutribase.test | password |\n| Patient — Fatima Hadžić (patient 16) | fatima.hadzic@nutribase.test | password |\n| Patient — Stefan Jovanović (patient 17) | stefan.jovanovic@nutribase.test | password |\n| Patient — Lejla Kovačev (patient 18) | lejla.kovacev@nutribase.test | password |\n| Patient — Nermin Bašić (patient 19) | nermin.basic@nutribase.test | password |\n\n---\n\n## Journey Overview\n- **Chapter 1** — Authentication (login, identity, logout)\n- **Chapter 2** — Auto-generated API Documentation (Scramble)\n- **Chapter 3** — User Management (admin CRUD + soft-delete lifecycle)\n- **Chapter 4** — Patient Registry (multi-role access, clinical profiles)\n- **Chapter 5** — Visit Workflow (full CRUD + pagination + scoping)\n- **Chapter 6** — Authorization & Validation (error cases)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "doctor_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "patient_token", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Chapter 1 — Authentication",
      "description": "Establish authenticated sessions for all three roles. Run 1.1–1.3 first — test scripts auto-save tokens to collection variables used by every subsequent request.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Login as Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', json.data.token);",
                  "    console.log('admin_token saved');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"hajrovica@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Test12345\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Login as Doctor",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('doctor_token', json.data.token);",
                  "    console.log('doctor_token saved');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"doctor@nutribase.test\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 Login as Patient — Marko Petrović",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('patient_token', json.data.token);",
                  "    console.log('patient_token saved');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"marko.petrovic@nutribase.test\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.4 Get Current Identity — Admin",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/user", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "user"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.5 Get Current Identity — Doctor",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/user", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "user"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.6 Get Current Identity — Patient",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{patient_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/user", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "user"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.7 Login — Invalid Credentials (→ 401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"hajrovica@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"wrongpassword\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.8 Logout",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/logout", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "logout"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Chapter 2 — API Documentation (Scramble)",
      "description": "Auto-generated API documentation powered by Scramble (dedoc/scramble). The UI provides an interactive explorer; the JSON endpoint exposes the full OpenAPI 3.1 spec consumable by any compatible tool (Swagger UI, Redoc, Stoplight, etc.).\n\nOpen 2.1 in a browser to explore the full schema interactively.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 Interactive API Docs UI (Scramble)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "text/html" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/docs/api", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["docs", "api"] },
            "description": "Opens the Scramble interactive documentation UI. All endpoints, request/response schemas, and authentication requirements are documented automatically from the codebase — no manual spec maintenance required.\n\nOpen this URL in a browser for the full interactive experience."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 OpenAPI Spec (JSON) — Machine-readable",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/docs/api.json", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["docs", "api.json"] },
            "description": "Returns the full OpenAPI 3.1 specification as JSON. Can be imported into Postman, Swagger UI, Redoc, Stoplight, or any OpenAPI-compatible tooling."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Chapter 3 — User Management (Admin)",
      "description": "Admin-only user CRUD. Demonstrates role-based access, soft-delete lifecycle (delete → restore → force-delete), and role enforcement (patient blocked from listing users).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3.1 List All Users — Admin (includes soft-deleted)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.2 List All Users — Doctor (active only)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.3 Get Single User — Admin",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/1", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "1"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.4 Create New Doctor User",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_token}}" }] },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Dr. Hana Begić\",\n  \"email\": \"hana.begic@nutribase.test\",\n  \"password\": \"password\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"password\",\n  \"role\": \"doktor\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.5 Update User Name — Admin",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_token}}" }] },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Dr. Amina Halilović-Bašić\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/37", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "37"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.6 Soft-Delete User — Admin",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_token}}" }] },
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/43", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "43"] },
            "description": "Soft-deletes the user. Their patient record and socioeconomic data are cascade soft-deleted. Run 3.1 after this to confirm the user still appears for admin (trashed) but not in 3.2 (doctor sees active only)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.7 Restore Soft-Deleted User — Admin",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_token}}" }] },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/43/restore", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "43", "restore"] },
            "description": "Restores the user and cascade-restores their patient + socioeconomic records."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.8 Force-Delete User Permanently — Admin",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_token}}" }] },
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/43/force", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "43", "force"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.9 Patient Tries to List Users (→ 403)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{patient_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Chapter 4 — Patient Registry",
      "description": "Patient management with multi-role access control. Each of the 5 demo patients has a distinct clinical scenario. Demonstrates policy-scoped list (patient sees only self), cross-patient access blocking, create with socioeconomic data, and soft-delete cascade.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4.1 List All Patients — Admin",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.2 List All Patients — Doctor",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.3 List Patients — Patient Sees Only Self",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{patient_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients"] },
            "description": "Same endpoint as 4.1 and 4.2. Policy filters the query to return only Marko's own record — 1 result instead of 5."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.4 View Patient 15 — Marko Petrović (Obesity + Hypertension, 11 Visits)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients/15", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients", "15"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.5 View Patient 16 — Fatima Hadžić (Type 2 Diabetes, 10 Visits)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients/16", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients", "16"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.6 View Patient 17 — Stefan Jovanović (Anorexia Recovery, 9 Visits)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients/17", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients", "17"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.7 View Patient 18 — Lejla Kovačev (Post-Bariatric, 2 Visits)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients/18", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients", "18"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.8 View Patient 19 — Nermin Bašić (CKD Stage 3, No Visits)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients/19", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients", "19"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.9 Create New Patient with Socioeconomic Data",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": 43,\n  \"first_name\": \"Demo\",\n  \"last_name\": \"NewPatient\",\n  \"date_of_birth\": \"1990-05-15\",\n  \"gender\": \"F\",\n  \"phone\": \"+387 61 000 001\",\n  \"address\": \"Titova 1\",\n  \"city\": \"Sarajevo\",\n  \"postal_code\": \"71000\",\n  \"emergency_contact_name\": \"Emergency Contact\",\n  \"emergency_contact_phone\": \"+387 61 000 002\",\n  \"blood_type\": \"O+\",\n  \"allergies\": \"None known\",\n  \"medical_notes\": \"New intake. Initial assessment pending.\",\n  \"socioeconomic\": {\n    \"marital_status\": \"single\",\n    \"employment_status\": \"employed_full_time\",\n    \"income_level\": \"middle\",\n    \"has_health_insurance\": true,\n    \"smoking_status\": \"never\",\n    \"alcohol_consumption\": \"occasional\",\n    \"physical_activity_level\": \"moderately_active\",\n    \"food_security_status\": \"food_secure\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients"] },
            "description": "Creates patient profile and socioeconomic record atomically in a single DB transaction."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.10 Update Patient Medical Notes + Socioeconomic — Doctor",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"medical_notes\": \"CKD stage 3. Updated after latest nephrology consultation — GFR stable at 42. Continue renal diet, added phosphate binder.\",\n  \"socioeconomic\": {\n    \"physical_activity_level\": \"lightly_active\",\n    \"additional_notes\": \"Community nurse increased visits to 3x weekly. Patient enrolled in social support program.\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients/19", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients", "19"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.11 Patient Views Own Profile (→ 200)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{patient_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients/15", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients", "15"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.12 Patient Accesses Another Patient's Profile (→ 403)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{patient_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients/16", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients", "16"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.13 Soft-Delete Patient — Admin (cascades to socioeconomic)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{admin_token}}" }] },
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients/19", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients", "19"] },
            "description": "Nermin has no visits, making him safe to delete for demo purposes. Soft-delete cascades to his patient_socioeconomic record."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Chapter 5 — Visit Workflow",
      "description": "Full visit lifecycle across multiple patients. Demonstrates: paginated visit history, single visit retrieval, create, update, delete, patient self-access, cross-patient scoping (404), and cross-patient access blocking (403).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "5.1 List Marko's Visit History — Doctor (Paginated, 11 Visits)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients/15/visits", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients", "15", "visits"] },
            "description": "Returns paginated visit history ordered newest-first. Response includes data[], meta (pagination), and links (navigation)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5.2 List Marko's Visits — Patient Views Own History",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{patient_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients/15/visits", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients", "15", "visits"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5.3 Show Single Visit — Marko Visit 11",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/patients/15/visits/11", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "patients", "15", "visits", "11"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5.4 Create New Visit for Marko — Doctor",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{doctor_token}}" }] },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"date\": \"2026-04-20\",\n  \"notes\": \"Quarterly review. Weight down 2.3kg since last visit. BMI now 31.8. Patient reports consistent gym attendance 3x/week. Adjusted protein targets to support muscle preservation. Reducing caloric deficit slightly to avoid fatigue.\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
